// complexity from O(loops * invariants) to O(1) postcondition frame checks.
//
// Functional strategy: let the model reason freely for roughly half the budget
// (prefixBudget = maxSteps / 2), then guide it through a constrained <<EXPR>>
// span for the arithmetic answer. The guidance string emphasizes multi-variable
// expressions to counter the single-token premature closure observed in
// diagnostics ("Visible span token length: avg 1.60, median 1.00").
// A boostAmount of 2.0 soft-preferences grammar-valid continuations and a
// narrowThreshold of 3 triggers dead-end avoidance when fewer than 3 valid
// next tokens remain.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
// No while loops exist in this body, so there are no loop invariants to maintain.
// The proof reduces to checking that postconditions flow from helper contracts:
//
// 1. parser_validity (insideConstrainedOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut)):
