//    `insideConstrained ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrained)` directly
//    satisfies the ensures clause.
//    Branch maxSteps > 0: GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan guarantees
//    `i ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(c)` and `!i ==> c == []` in its postcondition;
//    assigning insideConstrainedOut := i and currentConstrainedOut := c
//    propagates this guarantee to the out-parameters.
//
// 2. progress (|generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps):
//    Branch maxSteps == 0: generated := generatedPrefix so |generated| =
//    |generatedPrefix| <= |generatedPrefix| + 0. cost = 0 = maxSteps. ✓
//    Branch maxSteps > 0: GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan's cost bound guarantees
//    |g| <= |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps; assigning generated := g and
//    cost := maxSteps satisfies both |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps
//    and cost <= maxSteps. Since maxSteps > 0, cost = maxSteps > 0, satisfying
//    the progress disjunct `cost > 0` without requiring any change to generated. ✓
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END

